throughout the extracted text', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'University at Buffalo, Center for Inclusive Design and Environmental Access', 'Buffalo, NY', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Center for Inclusive Design and Environmental Access (IDeA), School of Architecture and Planning, University at Buffalo, The State University of New York', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://idea.ap.buffalo.edu/wp-content/uploads/sites/110/2020/01/AnthropometryofWheeledMobilityProject_FinalReport.pdf', '2026-11-06', NULL, NULL, 3, 'grey', 'US', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'COMPLETE', 'VERIFIED', 'NO-MATCH', NULL, NULL, 1, 'US federal contract research report prepared for the US Access Board (contract TPD-ABA-07-C-001, initially funded by NIDRR grant H133E99005), dated 31 December 2010, hosted by the authoring centre; not peer reviewed. A primary measurement study of wheeled mobility device users, so its figures are measurements, not a committee assertion.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-11-06 04:32', 'session_2026-11-06-pipeline-batch-2', '2026-11-06 04:33', 'session_2026-11-06-pipeline-batch-2', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, '173', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'intrinsic', 'pending', 'deferred', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'CLOSED', 'direct-render', NULL);
